# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:2
translate ja travel_event_deer_1df70267:

    # "Whilst making my way through some meadows, I stumbled upon some deer grazing upon the grass."
    "草原を歩いていると、草を食んでいる鹿の群れに出会った。"

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:5
translate ja travel_event_deer_b632c376:

    # "The thought crossed my mind that their hide and meat could prove valuable... {i}If we can catch them before they bolt.{/i}"
    "彼らの肉や皮は役に立つかもしれない…そんな考えが頭をよぎった。
{i}もし捕まえられればの話だが。{/i}"

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:10
translate ja travel_event_deer_783b92c5:

    # "As I drew closer, I tried using one of my tentacles to spring and strike at the deer quickly!"
    "近づきながら、一本の触手を使って鹿に素早く飛びかかろうとした!"

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:11
translate ja travel_event_deer_76af3f6a:

    # "Rushing out to protect its mate, a stag came charging out, stood between me and my prize..."
    "番を守るために、一頭の牡鹿が突進してきて、私と獲物の間に立ちはだかった…"

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:17
translate ja travel_event_deer_69e9c81c:

    # "As the stag fell, the doe had long since sprinted off..."
    "雄ジカが倒れたとき、雌ジカはとうに走り去っていた…"

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:18
translate ja travel_event_deer_2c1ec83b:

    # "Still though, the stag's hide and meat would prove worthwhile in itself."
    "とはいえ、雄鹿の毛皮や肉はそれ自体に価値があるだろう。"

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:20
translate ja travel_event_deer_783b92c5_1:

    # "As I drew closer, I tried using one of my tentacles to spring and strike at the deer quickly!"
    "近づくにつれ、私は一本の触手を使って素早く鹿に飛びかかり、攻撃を試みた!"

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:21
translate ja travel_event_deer_39c082ad:

    # "As the tentacle pierced the soft, warm, flesh, the doe yelped in pain as the others fled."
    "触手が柔らかく温かい肉を貫くと、牝鹿は苦痛に悲鳴を上げ、他の鹿たちは逃げ去った。"

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:23
translate ja travel_event_deer_82dab113:

    # "The doe quickly collapsed to the floor, shaking briefly before I put the thing out of it's misery with a quick blow."
    "牝鹿は素早く床に崩れ落ち、短く震えた後、私は一撃でそれを苦痛から解放した。"

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:24
translate ja travel_event_deer_0a2fa116:

    # "As the red, warm blood pooled, I pulled out a small knife and began to skin my prize..."
    "赤く温かい血がたまる中、私は小さなナイフを取り出し、獲物の皮を剥ぎ始めた…"

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:28
translate ja travel_event_deer_1b79797c:

    # "I drew closer towards them, ready to strike with a tentacle I planned to spring from my palm like a spear."
    "二人に近づいて、手のひらから槍かのように飛び出させた触手で仕掛けようとした。"

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:29
translate ja travel_event_deer_90807d48:

    # "Unfortunately, after feeling a fallen branch snap beneath my feet, the spooked deer bolted before I could make my move."
    "残念ながら、足元の折れた枝が砕ける音に驚いた鹿は、私が手を出す間もなく逃げ出してしまった。"

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:32
translate ja travel_event_deer_cc57066b:

    # MC "(Damn!)"
    MC "(くそっ!)"

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:33
translate ja travel_event_deer_d27fcd00:

    # MC "(Perhaps next time...)"
    MC "(また今度・・・)"

# game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:35
translate ja travel_event_deer_e4800ca4:

    # "Deciding to leave the deer alone, I simply walked on by and continue to let them continue grazing in peace."
    "鹿をそのままにしておくことに決め、私はそのまま通り過ぎ、彼らが平和に草を食ませておくことにした。"

translate ja strings:

    # game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:7
    old "Try and catch them."
    new "捕まえてみな。"






    # game/data/travel_events/deer.rpy:34
    old "Leave them alone."
    new "ほっといてやれ"






